DNG ForwardMatrix camera-to-PCS conversion; preserves the legacy ColorMatrix
path for profiles without a usable FM. The math follows DNG SDK SetWhiteXY.
LibRaw does not expose profile/calibration signatures; nonidentity CC keeps
the legacy conversion until signature-aware metadata is available.

